          "legendFormat": "client_canceled {{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "upstream_timeout is the only one of the three the circuit breaker counts: headers never arrived, so the backend never answered. Its allowance widens with prompt size, so a long-context workload should not show up here just for being large. stream_idle_timeout and client_canceled both mean the upstream did answer."
